\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Exclusive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Chisel</b> is an admin tool obtainable only by using a Spawn Menu. Like the name implies, it's a tool used for ease of testing for chiseling. It has maxed out stats, capable of instantly shaving rocks and cutting metals, having no charge.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>The Admin Chisel</b> is a typical looking chisel with a glossy pink headpiece and pearly white handle. Headpiece is pink in color with the default legacy foil material applied to it. Handle is colored pearly white, using the default legacy wood material.\n</p><p>It shares the same model with all the other Chisels.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Like all the other admin tools, it too had an early texture with gigachad decal plastered over it.</li>\n<li>The <b>Admin Chisel</b> as well as other admin tools are publicly usable in \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.roblox.com/games/14171339725/Oaklands-100-Players\">Oaklands 100 Players</a>\", however this game is rarely unlocked by the developers.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163000\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 508/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 85/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019506/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!-